Use in Grove: FIGURE-FORMAT.md restates the C4 model's levels of detail and
its reading order from context to detail. It uses Grove's own words and the
site as it stood on 2026-11-17. Grove adapted those points and added rules of its own.
Simon Brown does not endorse Grove or its use of the C4 model.
